  {
    "id": "notification.feed-cache.unchanged-keeps",
    "description": "hash 一致且本地有 payload：沿用本地，不把 data:null 当空列表",
    "source": "PezMax-Go@061a888 k_admin/internal/kadmin/datum_notification.go:295-308",
    "input": {
      "kind": "feed-cache",
      "previous": { "hash": "a1b2", "hasPayload": true },
      "response": { "unchanged": true, "hash": "a1b2", "data": null }
    },
    "expect": { "action": "keep", "hash": "a1b2" }
  },
  {
    "id": "notification.feed-cache.unchanged-without-payload",
    "description": "unchanged 但本地没有可用 payload：立刻不带 hash 重取一次",
    "source": "spec/api/envelope.md §5 规则 5",
    "input": {
      "kind": "feed-cache",
      "previous": { "hash": "a1b2", "hasPayload": false },
      "response": { "unchanged": true, "hash": "a1b2", "data": null }
    },
    "expect": { "action": "refetch" }
  },
  {
    "id": "notification.feed-cache.changed-replaces",
    "description": "hash 变了（发布窗口推进也会让它变）：整体替换并记住新 hash",
    "source": "PezMax-Go@061a888 k_admin/internal/kadmin/datum_notification.go:283-306",
    "input": {
      "kind": "feed-cache",
      "previous": { "hash": "a1b2", "hasPayload": true },
      "response": {
        "unchanged": false,
        "hash": "c3d4",
        "data": [{ "notifyId": 10, "notifyType": "5", "displayMode": "1" }]
      }
    },
    "expect": { "action": "replace", "hash": "c3d4" }
  },
  {
    "id": "notification.feed-cache.empty-list",
    "description": "服务端没有可见通知：hash 是空数组的哈希，正常替换成空列表（这是真的没通知，不是缺 data）",
    "source": "PezMax-Go@061a888 k_admin/internal/kadmin/datum_notification.go:287-308",
    "input": {
      "kind": "feed-cache",
      "previous": { "hash": "a1b2", "hasPayload": true },
      "response": { "unchanged": false, "hash": "e5f6", "data": [] }
    },
    "expect": { "action": "replace", "hash": "e5f6" }
  },
  {
    "id": "notification.feed-cache.changed-without-data",
    "description": "unchanged=false 却没有 data（上游不该这样）：保留本地并报错，别清空",
    "source": "spec/api/envelope.md §5 规则 6",
    "input": {
      "kind": "feed-cache",
      "previous": { "hash": "a1b2", "hasPayload": true },
      "response": { "unchanged": false, "hash": "c3d4", "data": null }
    },
    "expect": { "action": "keep-and-warn" }
  },
